verify the reverse split is complete and tax is reduced.

.why = confirm Delaware processed the amendment before your next annual report.

---

## check Delaware

search: https://icis.corp.delaware.gov/ecorp/entitysearch/namesearch.aspx

| field | expected |
|-------|----------|
| authorized shares | ≤ 5,000 |
| status | Good Standing |

---

## verify annual tax

file next annual report with:
- authorized shares: ≤ 5,000
- method: Authorized Shares Method
- tax: **$175**
- annual report fee: **$50** (non-exempt domestic; $25 if exempt)
- ⬅️ **the portal will show $225.** that is correct

> 🚩 **corrected 2026-09-02.** this section used to list the tax alone. the
> label was accurate and the instrument still misled: **a verification stone
> must state the number the driver will actually SEE.** a driver who filed,
> read $225 off the screen, and compared it against a stone that said $175
> would conclude the reduction had failed — or call the state about a $50
> overcharge that is simply the report fee.

⚠️ do not treat a $225 total as a defect. treat a total **above** $225 as one,
and take the tax line from `franchise.tax.delaware --authorized <count> …`
before you dispute the bill.

---

## checklist

- [ ] Certificate of Amendment filed and processed
- [ ] Delaware shows updated authorized shares
- [ ] Stock ledger updated
- [ ] Cap table updated (if applicable)
- [ ] Next annual report ready with new share count

